  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.archetypes.6kNXAIbQiXxn3r5r]{Pearls of Power}</p><p>You have a pearl of power. You can crush this pearl as an Interact action and grant your next Strike or Spell bonus damage of the type of the pearl. You can only hold and benefit from one pearl at a time, but you can pass this pearl to another creature within 30 feet.</p>"
